  "notes": "{火|ひ} is a fundamental noun for fire, flames, and heat sources.\n\nCOMMON EXPRESSIONS:\n- {火|ひ}をつける: to light, ignite\n- {火|ひ}を{消|け}す: to put out a fire\n- {火|ひ}を{起|お}こす: to start a fire\n- {火|ひ}に{気|き}をつける: to be careful with fire\n- {火|ひ}の{用心|ようじん}: fire prevention\n\nCOOKING TERMS:\n- {強火|つよび}: high heat\n- {弱火|よわび}: low heat\n- {中火|ちゅうび}: medium heat\n- とろ{火|び}: simmering\n\nCOMPOUNDS:\n- {火事|かじ}: fire (disaster)\n- {花火|はなび}: fireworks\n- {火山|かざん}: volcano\n- {火曜日|かようび}: Tuesday\n\nIDIOM:\n{火|ひ}に{油|あぶら}を{注|そそ}ぐ - to add fuel to the fire (make things worse)",
